9f85f-ab8a-489a-8986-9c2d1d2166ab","text":"I am packing for a short trip with uncertain weather and a return time that may slip. How would you keep the plan workable?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"e8d00a6e-edeb-4fbf-969e-bd4e822582ac","text":"Given the uncertain weather and potential time delays, your plan needs to be as flexible as possible. \n\nHere are a few ideas to make your trip \"workable\":\n\n*   **Flexible Packing:** Pack layers that are versatile—choose pieces that can be mixed and matched rather than relying on one specific outfit for every day.\n*   **Buffer Time:** If the return time might slip, don't over-schedule your activities. Build in a buffer of 1-2 hours per day just in case traffic or weather delays happen.\n*   **Emergency Contingency:** Always have a backup plan (e.g., \"If we are delayed, we'll meet at X time tomorrow\").\n*   **Prioritize:** Decide on the \"must-do\" vs. \"nice-to-do\" activities. If you have to cut something out, know what's most important to keep.\n\nDoes that sound like what you need?"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["current_input_echo"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s0","s1"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"current_input_echo","monitor_id":"candidate:e-12d9f1561870569aa95ab512","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s0","s1"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1"]},"evidence":{"end":101,"quote":"Given the uncertain weather and potential time delays, your plan needs to be as flexible as possible.","source_slot":"s1","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-12d9f1561870569aa95ab512","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligib